# 🛒 Retail Performance Dashboard — Power BI

![Power BI](https://img.shields.io/badge/Power%20BI-F2C811?style=for-the-badge&logo=powerbi&logoColor=black)
![DAX](https://img.shields.io/badge/DAX-0078D4?style=for-the-badge&logo=microsoft&logoColor=white)
![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/Status-Completed-brightgreen?style=for-the-badge)

An end-to-end **Retail Performance Dashboard** built in Power BI, designed to give business stakeholders a 360° view of Sales, Customer behaviour, and Product performance — all in one interactive report.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

Retail businesses generate enormous amounts of transactional data daily. This dashboard transforms raw retail data into clear, actionable insights — enabling faster decisions on pricing, inventory, and customer strategy.

| Area | Key Focus |
|---|---|
| 💰 Sales | Revenue trends, MoM growth, regional performance |
| 👥 Customer | Segmentation, retention, top customers by value |
| 📦 Product | Best/worst sellers, category contribution, profit margins |

---

