## 🎯 Business Questions Answered

- Which products and categories are driving the most revenue?
- Who are our top customers and what is their buying behaviour?
- How is sales performance trending month-over-month and year-over-year?
- Which regions/stores are underperforming?
- What is the contribution of each product category to total profit?

---

## 🖥️ Dashboard Pages

### Page 1 — Sales Overview
- Total Revenue, Total Orders, Average Order Value (KPI cards)
- Monthly Revenue Trend (line chart)
- Sales by Region (map / bar chart)
- YoY and MoM Growth %

### Page 2 — Customer Analysis
- Total Customers, New vs Returning Customers
- Customer Segmentation (High / Mid / Low value)
- Top 10 Customers by Revenue
- Purchase Frequency Distribution

### Page 3 — Product Performance
- Top 10 Products by Revenue and Profit
- Category-wise Sales Contribution (donut / bar chart)
- Product Profitability Matrix
- Slow-moving / Low-performing Products

