## ⚙️ DAX Measures Used

```dax
-- Total Revenue
Total Revenue = SUM(Sales[Amount])

-- Total Orders
Total Orders = COUNTROWS(Sales)

-- Average Order Value
Avg Order Value = DIVIDE([Total Revenue], [Total Orders])

-- Sales Last Year
Sales LY = CALCULATE([Total Revenue], SAMEPERIODLASTYEAR(Date[Date]))

-- Year-over-Year Growth
YoY Growth % =
DIVIDE([Total Revenue] - [Sales LY], [Sales LY])

-- Month-over-Month Growth
MoM Growth % =
VAR CurrentMonth = [Total Revenue]
VAR PrevMonth    = CALCULATE([Total Revenue], PREVIOUSMONTH(Date[Date]))
RETURN DIVIDE(CurrentMonth - PrevMonth, PrevMonth)

-- Year-to-Date Sales
Sales YTD = TOTALYTD([Total Revenue], Date[Date])

-- % of Total Sales
% of Total Sales = DIVIDE([Total Revenue], CALCULATE([Total Revenue], ALL(Sales)))

-- Customer Segmentation
Customer Segment =
VAR Revenue = [Total Revenue]
RETURN
    IF(Revenue >= 50000, "High Value",
    IF(Revenue >= 20000, "Mid Value", "Low Value"))

-- Top 10 Customers Flag
Is Top 10 Customer =
IF(
    RANKX(ALL(Customer[CustomerID]), [Total Revenue], , DESC, DENSE) <= 10,
    "Top 10", "Others"
)
```

