## 🗂️ Data Model

The dashboard follows a **Star Schema** design for optimal performance:

```
         Date Table
              |
Customers ── Fact Sales ── Products
              |
           Regions
```

| Table | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| Fact_Sales | Fact | Core transactions — orders, revenue, quantity |
| Dim_Customer | Dimension | Customer details and segments |
| Dim_Product | Dimension | Product names, categories, cost/price |
| Dim_Date | Dimension | Calendar table with Year, Month, Quarter |
| Dim_Region | Dimension | Store / geographic data |

---

## 🗂️ Dataset

| Field | Description |
|---|---|
| Order ID | Unique transaction identifier |
| Order Date | Date of purchase |
| Customer ID | Unique customer identifier |
| Product | Product name and category |
| Region | Geographic location |
| Sales Amount | Revenue per transaction |
| Quantity | Units sold |
| Profit | Profit per transaction |

> **Dataset Source:** [Mention your source — e.g. Kaggle Sample Superstore / UCI Repository / Internal]

